       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. NUMERIC-SEMANTICS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-SIGNED PIC S9(3) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-RATE PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           MOVE -1234 TO WS-SIGNED.
           MOVE 1234.567 TO WS-RATE.
           IF WS-SIGNED = -234
               DISPLAY "SIGNED-OK"
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "SIGNED-FAIL"
           END-IF.
           DISPLAY WS-RATE.
           STOP RUN.
